Bill images: 100 long multilingual lines, grapheme-safe wrapping, bounded amounts and measured footer height passed.
Bill sharing: localized text, image labels, share title and custom footer passed.
GST contract tests passed: selling-price tax, buying discounts, fractional quantities, mixed rates, IST ranges and retained-document tampering.
Period recovery checks outcomes only, preserves pending evidence on failure, and rejects stale or cross-account requests. Review defaults and preparation details match native.
Purchase drafts: refreshed identity invalidation, immutable review evidence, invoice-only services and request metadata isolation passed.
Browser journal tests passed: immutable retries, scope isolation, confirmed retention, atomic reservations and concurrent locks.
Financial outcome tests passed: lost response recovery, original identity replay, uncertain outcome retention and delayed account-switch rejection.
Original quantity, depleted receipts, existing links and cost eligibility passed.
Purchase reversal dependencies and exact-paise checks passed.
Purchase closure preserves exact evidence, guards stale state/scope, and requires verified terminal receipts.
Web parity tests passed: browser hashes, RSP package review, mixed invoice rendering, rounded credits, cumulative returns, scope/tamper rejection, tax timelines and selected-document print output.
GST check results: complete, issues, partial, failed/stale, never checked, unavailable and offline states passed.
Customer snapshot: existing customer identity/display, draft client ID, blank selection and immutable legacy retry passed.
Local receipt: tax/composition/rounding, exact request binding, scope/tamper rejection, atomic lost-response retention and immutable replay passed.
Queued stock: concurrent last-unit reservation, stale-cache confirmation, fresh baseline and reconnect replay passed.
Invoice preparation: number/grant reuse, no counter consumption and immutable lost-response grant retry passed.
Ordinary receipts: discount/payment totals, immutable request binding, scope/tamper guards, consecutive queued stock and original reconnect replay passed.
Checkout persistence: readback, silent storage refusal, original request preservation and account separation passed.
Voice review: product scope, active/priced stock, quantities, duplicate aggregation, tax preservation and atomic cart failure passed.
Offline shop context: account/session scope, expiry, minimal routing data, reduced permissions, denial and verified storage passed.
Offline evidence: scope, integrity, age, auth rejection, storage refusal and stale response/write invalidation passed.
Retained rounding preview: exact interval, scope, immutable capture and policy consistency passed.
Premium evidence: active/trial exact expiry, temporary server grant, cache expiry and private billing redaction passed.
Offline API: complete catalog retention, cost redaction, tax subset capture, missing product, session separation and denied POS invalidation passed.
Browser audio: MIME/base64, 30-second stop, cancellation, pending permission cleanup and denial passed.
Parity API: filtered pagination, refunds path, guarded authorization, conflict and role denial passed.
Web API sessions: stale sends/retries, JSON/CSV and export metadata rejected; current-session refresh passed.
Pagination: large exports, short pages, stalled endpoints and network failure passed.
Dates: ten languages, midnight IST boundary, invalid dates and foreign timezones passed.
Tax history: invalid captures, bounded waits, effective-boundary refresh, cancellation and resumed clock passed.
Counter parity: query recovery, serial repeated scans, late camera cleanup, denied storage, separate checkout locks and safe draft cleanup passed.
Counter shell waits for the replacement worker before warming cached routes.
Billing shell: warm complete resources, navigation fallback, no API/auth/RSC/query caching, denied auth response preservation, logout clear and optional storage passed.
Browser push worker: account isolation, signout, safe destinations, stale clicks, denied storage and malformed payload passed.
Browser push sessions: stale work isolation, serialized account switches, retries, rotated keys and worker acknowledgement failure/timeout passed.
Verified 64 vendored GST contracts.

